WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Git Sync feedback: theme-aware semantic colors.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Before: hard-coded red utilities.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Light+ theme. The same repository check and sync failure use raw red utility colors.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
After: semantic feedback tokens.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:17.200
Same failure states, now using theme-aware feedback colors.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.200
Same failure path; clearer feedback in Light+.
